  "summary": "Static tests cover reconstituting an order, a bounded over-refund rejection, preservation of a partial refund and completion at the exact remaining amount. Order.Reconstitute copies the financial and operational fields, refund amount and refunds collection, with optional cancellation and tax/discount snapshot fields. The test helper does not pass those optional fields and the “every persisted field” test asserts only Id, Total, Status, IsPaid and RefundAmount, so cancellation/tax/discount rehydration is not covered here; source assignment itself is present. Existing source shard records an encapsulation concern: Refunds exposes the underlying List through IReadOnlyList and a caller cast could bypass RefundAmount synchronization; actual reachable cast/use remains unknown. No new defect promoted; FIN-003 remains the existing unpaid-refund finding.",
